; The zone whose name server lives in another zone.  Its own apex says
; the same thing the referral did, and it has no address to offer for
; the name either: the name is not below this zone, so it could not
; carry one that anybody should believe.
$ORIGIN example.
$TTL 3600
@	IN	SOA	ns.sibling. root.example. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@	IN	NS	ns.sibling.
www	IN	A	192.0.2.1
